CHALLENGE 4: THE MULTIPLAYER LOBBY (CyclicBarrier)
================================================================================
SCENARIO: You are building a 4-player game. Players join at different times,
but the game logic requires all 4 to be "Ready" before the map loads.

1. CLASS: 'GameLobby'
2. TOOL: 'CyclicBarrier barrier = new CyclicBarrier(4, () -> System.out.println("--- ALL PLAYERS READY! LOADING MAP ---"));'
3. TASK (PlayerTask):
   - Simulate a player "Connecting..." (Thread.sleep).
   - Print: Thread.getName() + " is waiting in the lobby."
   - Action: Call 'barrier.await()'.
   - Print: Thread.getName() + " has entered the game world!"

4. MAIN:
   - Start 4 threads representing players.

EXPECTATION: You will see players 1, 2, and 3 "waiting." Only when player 4
arrives will all of them move to the "entered game world" print statement
simultaneously.
